Save Me a Little of Today (把今天留一小块给我)
Song, lyrics: Chan Meng. The recording is the whole soundtrack, unaltered.

Picture: every frame is drawn by code in this folder. No image-generation model, no photographs, no SVG.
- paint/wc.py, paint/kit.py   procedural watercolour engine and drawing habits, carried over from A Coffee for One
                              (solo-coffee-mv, same author) with a new palette.
- paint/s_*.py, build.py      the paintings of this film, split by depth -> art/*.webp
- stage.js, shots_*.js, edit.js, type.js, post.js   camera, light, weather, handwriting, the cut, the lyric, WebGL pass.
- harness/, lib/, tools/      render harness and timing tools from solo-coffee-mv; tools/shotsheet.py, tools/qa.py and
                              tools/edit_list.mjs are new.

